== tests/fm-backend-tmux-smoke.test.sh
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_target_exists finds an existing pane
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_target_exists accepts bare and session-scoped window ids
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_target_exists accepts window indexes including firstmate:0
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_target_exists accepts index.pane targets
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_target_exists accepts a bare session and explicit exact markers
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_target_exists anchors the session name
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_target_exists rejects malformed targets
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_tmux_send_key withholds a key from a gone prefix target
ok - real tmux: a gone dotted window reads absent beside its undotted neighbor
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_target_exists rejects a killed window while another session stays alive
ok - real tmux: fm_backend_target_exists rejects a missing session while another session stays alive
ok - real tmux: kill removes the window and the readable session inventory authoritatively classifies it missing
ok - real tmux: container_ensure names the pane's own session, not a more recent grouped session
ok - real tmux: container_ensure falls back to the pane's surviving session when the $TMUX session id is stale
ok - real tmux: a dotted task id's sanitized window is targetable and killable
